{"slug":"disaster","title":"日本の災害と防災の歴史","lead":"1883年に日本で初めて作られた天気図から、関東大震災、伊勢湾台風、阪神・淡路大震災、東日本大震災、そして能登半島地震まで。地震・津波・台風・噴火の記録に、緊急地震速報や特別警報のように被害を減らすために生まれた仕組みを重ねてたどる。","description":"日本初の天気図から能登半島地震まで、日本を襲った地震・津波・台風・噴火と、被害を減らすために整えられてきた防災の仕組みを年代順にたどる特集。","icon":"art-kanto-earthquake","count":33,"fromDate":"1883-02-16","toDate":"2024-01-01","events":[{"id":"1883-02-16-18743166","date":"1883-02-16","precision":"day","title":"東京気象台（後の中央気象台）が日本で初めて天気図を作製（天気図記念日）","summary":"東京気象台（後の中央気象台）が日本で初めて天気図を作製（天気図記念日）","category":"society","region":"japan","importance":66.9,"sources":[{"label":"Wikipedia: 東京気象台","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E6%B0%97%E8%B1%A1%E5%8F%B0"},{"label":"Wikipedia: 1883年","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/1883%E5%B9%B4"}],"image":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/JMA_Toranomon_office_2020-11-24.jpg/960px-JMA_Toranomon_office_2020-11-24.jpg","width":640,"height":810,"credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:JMA_Toranomon_office_2020-11-24.jpg"},"related":[{"id":"1884-06-01-1302f083","date":"1884-06-01","title":"東京気象台が日本初の天気予報を発表"},{"id":"1875-06-01-725eb68f","date":"1875-06-01","title":"東京気象台設置"}]},{"id":"1888-07-15-2f3494b8","date":"1888-07-15","precision":"day","title":"磐梯山が千年ぶりに噴火し山体崩壊（発生した泥流などにより461名が犠牲）","summary":"磐梯山が千年ぶりに噴火し山体崩壊（発生した泥流などにより461名が犠牲）","category":"disaster","region":"japan","importance":62.9,"sources":[{"label":"Wikipedia: 磐梯山","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A3%90%E6%A2%AF%E5%B1%B1"},{"label":"Wikipedia: 1888年","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/1888%E5%B9%B4"}],"image":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Mt._Bandaisan_0811.JPG/960px-Mt._Bandaisan_0811.JPG","width":640,"height":480,"credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mt._Bandaisan_0811.JPG"}},{"id":"1891-10-28-0e82ba55","date":"1891-10-28","precision":"day","title":"濃尾地震発生（死者7,273名）","summary":"濃尾地震発生（死者7,273名）","category":"disaster","region":"japan","importan